user_prompt:
Validate this set of coded lines for compliance before claim submission. Each line may include a CPT/HCPCS code, modifier(s), units, and/or an ICD-10-CM diagnosis code — parse them from the raw input below (one code/line per row; formats seen include "99214-25-E11.69,I10,E78.5,D64.9" and "G0446-59-I10", i.e. CPT-MODIFIER-DX1,DX2,...).

Return ONLY this JSON object (no markdown, no extra text):
{
  "validation_result": "pass|fail|review",
  "line_findings": [
    {
      "codes_involved": [],
      "issue_type": "PTP_EDIT|MUE|ADD_ON_MISSING_PRIMARY|MODIFIER_REQUIRED|UNSPECIFIED_DIAGNOSIS|OTHER",
      "severity": "error|warning|info",
      "description": "",
      "recommendation": ""
    }
  ],
  "summary": ""
}

coded_input:
{{coded_input}}
